[{"type": "chat", "time": 7394.196, "timestamp": "02:03:14", "author": "@gaurdiangaming4603", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_mFiZLBZWkzinaMdP6tEYkP1j69A0G3jL01PKtnzXI=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "I never seen a streamer do so much haircare before 0.0"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 7396.78, "timestamp": "02:03:16", "author": "@notpravinlol", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/t9UXLD6AmzS1-YItB_6_Kz4uAutM3H0oNxaU47_WUxq4oWNpbcDQvZiftO3UE0nS_-jgazDe=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "having fun is also part of the trip"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7399.39, "timestamp": "02:03:19", "text": "所以我只好梳頭，不然頭髮就會變得非常蓬亂。所以我只好像這樣梳頭，但這甚至不是梳子。這是一個轉角。  我知道這一點。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7409.99, "timestamp": "02:03:29", "text": "我正在用它來"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7412.149, "timestamp": "02:03:32", "text": "梳頭。  旅途中享受樂趣也是其中的一部分。  是的。是的。這其實不算是一次旅行，對吧？這不是一次旅行。我要搬到那裡去。如果兩個都行，我會在那裡待兩年多。是的。是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7423.43, "timestamp": "02:03:43", "text": "。  是的。如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7429.03, "timestamp": "02:03:49", "text": "你想的話，可以嘗試做兼職。確實有人參與。兼職對我來說是必須的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7432.709, "timestamp": "02:03:52", "text": "呃，我必須在那裡做兼職才能生存下去，支付生活費、伙食費等等。啊，那真不錯。  驢驢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7434.39, "timestamp": "02:03:54", "text": "。我覺得驢子酒吧有時候適合兼職，因為很多外國人會來"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7436.709, "timestamp": "02:03:56", "text": "這裡。所以有時候他們會要求應徵者會說英語"}]